WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:02.794
I'm not a soldier.

00:00:05.422 --> 00:00:07.424
I fight for my family,
not the crown.

00:00:16.058 --> 00:00:17.643
This season,
we spent all this time

00:00:17.643 --> 00:00:19.061
like getting it to this point.

00:00:19.311 --> 00:00:20.896
We wanted to build the tension

00:00:20.896 --> 00:00:22.356
between all the
different characters.

00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:25.609
Everyone close to you
always ends up suffering.

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:27.736
Now it’s your turn brother.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.781
Everyone is constantly 
changing and evolving.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:34.576
They manipulate each other so
things become really tense.

00:00:35.202 --> 00:00:36.787
There can only ever 
be one queen!

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:37.996
And she is me.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:40.958
Every character has 
just hurt each other

00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:43.335
so deeply that it’s hard 
to trust alliances.

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:44.628
Where we go, he goes.

00:00:45.254 --> 00:00:46.463
I still don’t trust him.

00:00:47.214 --> 00:00:49.299
Maghra’s trying to 
save her people,

00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:51.802
her family, 
and do the right thing.

00:00:52.135 --> 00:00:54.596
Whatever lie you tell, 
becomes my lie as well. 

00:00:55.347 --> 00:00:58.308
If the queen says it, 
it’s not a lie. 

00:01:00.269 --> 00:01:03.355
This season, characters are
extremely complex.

00:01:03.855 --> 00:01:06.942
Everyone has some kind of
vendetta against each other.

00:01:07.609 --> 00:01:09.778
When you left I was 
still the weaker one,

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:10.862
that’s not longer the case.

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.782
As the season continues,

00:01:13.782 --> 00:01:16.285
we see a tension build
between everyone.

00:01:16.994 --> 00:01:19.371
After everything, you still
think you’re special.

00:01:19.413 --> 00:01:20.330
We are special.

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:22.416
The cracks that were already
starting to show

00:01:22.416 --> 00:01:23.959
throughout season one 
just start widening.

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.088
The things we do for family.

00:01:29.965 --> 00:01:31.758
My own brother stands between us

00:01:33.719 --> 00:01:34.594
and victory.

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:40.851
No matter the
outcome, I will lose.

00:01:43.437 --> 00:01:44.521
To protect his children.

00:01:44.563 --> 00:01:46.273
It's driving force for Baba.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:50.027
So, when Baba sees his brother,
he wants to just, arrgh!

00:01:50.027 --> 00:01:51.236
Full attack!

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:53.530
Everything about Baba 
and Edo’s life

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:55.490
was just leading to 
this match up.

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:57.409
I don’t want to kill you.

00:01:58.452 --> 00:01:59.161
Don’t worry,

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.038
you’re not going to.

